## Notes

Change scope: extend drive_start with an opt-in onboarding-keystroke
dance (env-var SMOKE_DRIVE_ONBOARDING_ENTERS). Wire entry.sh V2i to set
it to 2 for real-claude drives. No changes to the 5-verb interface;
no changes to per-skill drives or catalog. Fake_claude tests default to 0
(unchanged behavior).

Reviewed against `docs/adrs/`:
- ADR-006 (install harness) — Docker cold-adopter harness. Not touched;
  the dance is a smoke-expect verb extension, not a harness contract shift.
- ADR-002/003/004/005 — bassclef init/sync/publish/npm. Not touched.

The dance is a test-harness cure for a Claude Code CLI first-run
onboarding surface. No pinned ADR governs this surface.
